+### `thrownAt([error])`
+
+Returns the filename, line number, and column number of where the `error` was created. If
+no error is provided, the current location returned.
+
+```js
+const Code = require('code');
+
+const error = new Error('oops');
+Code.thrownAt(error);
+```
+
